<title>FINLAND: Huhtamaki share suspended - bourse.</title>
<headline>Huhtamaki share suspended - bourse.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in Finnish confectionery and packaging group Huhtamaki Oy was suspended at the company's request on the Helsinki Stock Exchange on Friday pending an announcement at 1600/1300 GMT, a bourse official said.</p>
<p>Before the suspension, Huhtamaki traded at 182.00 markka, down 3.00.</p>
<p>Huhtamaki declined to comment.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 242</p>
